Run options:
1. For simple single WRITE and READ TX you can run "axi_samle_test"
2. Test for sequential WRITE and READ from same Address
  +num_wr_tx=10 +num_rd_tx=2 +test_name=axi_back_to_back_wr_rd_test 
3. Test for Random read and write from random address "The preload test":
  +num_rd_tx=2 +test_name=axi_back_to_back_wr_rd_test +preload=1